WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.450
Arizona numbers in two minutes.

2
00:00:02.509 --> 00:00:06.037
These are the numbers that show up again and again on the exam.

3
00:00:06.983 --> 00:00:07.946
Licensing.

4
00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:12.056
You get four exam attempts in a twelve-month period, then you wait a year.

5
00:00:12.347 --> 00:00:15.597
After you pass, apply for your license within one year.

6
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:20.461
Your license lasts four years and expires on the last day of your birth month.

7
00:00:20.752 --> 00:00:24.501
Each term, you need forty-eight hours of continuing education,

8
00:00:24.525 --> 00:00:26.545
including six hours of ethics.

9
00:00:26.998 --> 00:00:31.297
Report a change of address, or an action against you in another state,

10
00:00:31.317 --> 00:00:32.721
within thirty days.

11
00:00:32.815 --> 00:00:36.669
And complete four hours of annuity training before you sell annuities.

12
00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:39.031
Policy provisions.

13
00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:42.212
A life policy's free look is at least ten days.

14
00:00:42.503 --> 00:00:44.557
The grace period is thirty days.

15
00:00:44.918 --> 00:00:49.805
You can reinstate within three years, with interest of no more than six percent.

16
00:00:50.166 --> 00:00:53.258
A policy becomes incontestable after two years,

17
00:00:53.278 --> 00:00:55.878
and the suicide exclusion lasts two years.

18
00:00:56.111 --> 00:01:00.440
And group life can be converted to an individual policy within thirty-one days,

19
00:01:00.464 --> 00:01:03.157
with no evidence of insurability.

20
00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:05.571
Replacement and annuities.

21
00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:08.589
A replacement policy gets a thirty-day free look.

22
00:01:08.822 --> 00:01:13.036
The replacing insurer must notify the existing insurer within five business days,

23
00:01:13.095 --> 00:01:15.230
and keep its records for five years.

24
00:01:15.892 --> 00:01:18.353
An annuity's free look is ten days,

25
00:01:18.412 --> 00:01:20.872
thirty days if the owner is sixty-five or older,

26
00:01:20.896 --> 00:01:25.145
and fifteen days if no buyer's guide was provided at application.

27
00:01:26.071 --> 00:01:28.090
Federal rules and the guaranty fund.

28
00:01:28.323 --> 00:01:30.168
Before age fifty-nine and a half,

29
00:01:30.193 --> 00:01:34.770
a ten percent penalty generally applies to taxable gains taken early from a MEC or

30
00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:35.625
an annuity.

31
00:01:36.079 --> 00:01:39.410
The seven-pay test decides whether a policy is a MEC.

32
00:01:39.643 --> 00:01:44.008
Employer-paid group term life is tax-free up to fifty thousand dollars of coverage.

33
00:01:44.369 --> 00:01:48.052
And Arizona's guaranty fund covers up to three hundred thousand dollars in life

34
00:01:48.072 --> 00:01:51.984
insurance death benefits, one hundred thousand in cash value,

35
00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:55.107
and two hundred fifty thousand in annuity value.

36
00:01:56.039 --> 00:01:58.139
Review these the morning of your exam.

37
00:01:58.373 --> 00:02:01.495
One hundred questions, two hours, and seventy percent to pass.

38
00:02:01.856 --> 00:02:03.016
You've got this.
